{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"## Final classification table\n\n| Candidate | Final classification | Forward rule | Historical counterexample result |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Nonempty parsed AC item | HARD CLARITY FLOOR | Join continuations; fail only when the complete standard checkbox body is whitespace-empty | None found among signed+completed tickets |\n| Exact duplicate AC item | ADVISORY ONLY | Report both locations; never fail clarity solely for redundancy | 8d27-7ee1-f137-4b88 repeats the global make lint/typecheck/test gate and still passed both reviews |\n| Unresolved sentinel | HARD CLARITY FLOOR, NARROWED | Only sentinel-as-value forms in exact active execution sections, outside code; suppress removal/negation assertions | No counterexample after narrowing; c244-ba53-6280-4702 is the required PASS control for “NO stale TODO” |\n| Present file-impact path/reason integrity | WRITE-SCHEMA INVARIANT, NOT CLARITY | Reject malformed structured input at mutation boundary; allow absent file impact | None found; no independent clarity value |\n| `[rebar:id]` direct edge | GROUNDING EXCEPTION ONLY, NOT RAW CLARITY | Check only when an absent file/symbol is claiming prerequisite-created credit | Naive rule disproved by 6673-7636-a116-4f90 and 94f9-a9a0-7475-4e75 provenance/downstream citations |\n| Preferred sections/aliases | ADVISORY ONLY | Coach toward author-guide shape | Prior audit counterexamples remain controlling |\n| Per-AC proof coverage | ADVISORY ONLY | Emit evidence coverage; no hard verdict | Prior audit counterexamples remain controlling |\n| Compound/vague/hedged AC text | ADVISORY ONLY | Surface lexical signal for semantic review | Prior audit counterexamples remain controlling |\n| Testing happy+